#: ../../../source/sms.rst:191
msgid ""
"It's faster to actually try some test code againts the API to see "
"immediate results. `Signing up "
"<https://www.xoxzo.com/en/accounts/signup/>`_ takes only a few minutes "
"and it's free"
msgstr ""
